{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27414","headline":"陈情上郑主司 · 顾非熊","name":"陈情上郑主司","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登第久无缘，归情思渺然。\n艺慙公道日，身贱太平年。\n未识笙歌乐，虚逢岁月迁。\n羁怀吟独苦，愁眼媿花妍。\n求达非荣己，修辞欲继先。\n秦城春十二，吴苑路三千。\n茅屋山岚入，柴门海浪连。\n遥心犹送鴈，归梦不离船。\n时节思家夜，风霜作客天。\n庭闱乖旦暮，兄弟阻团圆。\n朝乏新知己，邨荒旧业田。\n受恩期望外，效死誓生前。\n愿察爲裘意，彷徉和角篇。\n恳情今吐尽，万一冀哀怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}